### List approvals [GET /api/merchant/v1/approvals{?page,page_size}]

Your approvals, newest first, each with the device it was raised on.
+ Parameters
    + page: `1` (string, optional)
    + page_size: `50` (string, optional)

+ Request The first page

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer sca_live_9WKUq7yTdNjF2m...

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
              "data": [
                {
                  "binding": {
                    "activated_at": "2026-08-20T21:07:35.123081Z",
                    "attested": false,
