### Fetch an approval [GET /api/merchant/v1/approvals/{id}]

What a webhook would have told you, for anyone who would rather poll.

Once it is answered, the approval carries the evidence: `signature`,
`signed_payload` — the exact string the device signed — and
`payload_hash`, the hash of the params it covers.

+ Parameters
    + id: `7bf994ae-9331-4f0b-ac3c-f4b66a664276` (string, required)

+ Request One the user confirmed

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer sca_live_9WKUq7yTdNjF2m...

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
              "binding": {
                "activated_at": "2026-08-20T21:07:36.190388Z",
                "attested": false,
                "external_id": "customer-4471",
                "id": "6bea6b94-692b-4e17-ab75-0746aabcaa51",
                "last_seen_at": null,
                "name": "Dana's iPhone",
                "push_platform": "ios",
                "revoked_at": null,
                "status": "active"
              },
              "created_at": "2026-08-20T21:07:36.192601Z",
