### Cancel an approval [POST /api/merchant/v1/approvals/{id}/cancel]

Closes a card the user has not answered. One that was already answered,
cancelled or expired is `409 not_pending`.

+ Parameters
    + id: `b323da78-b17c-45ba-86b0-1e6db67f1dce` (string, required)

+ Request Nobody had answered it yet

